```
# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:投資蝕錢嗰陣，為咗防止損失進一步擴大，而即時將投資項目賣出或者平倉；止損（量詞：次）
eng:to stop loss; to cut one's losses
<eg>
yue:隻股票跌到穿晒底，都係快啲止蝕好啲。 (zek3 sik6 goek3 pou2 dit3 dou3 cyun1 saai3 dai2, dou1 hai6 faai3 di1 zi2 sik6 hou2 di1.)
eng:The stock price has fallen through the floor, it's better to cut your losses quickly.
``` [end of text]


